                </span>

                <h2>
                    Designed With
                    <span>Passion</span>
                </h2>

                <p>
                    We believe an album should be more than just a collection
                    of photographs. It should tell a story.
                </p>


                <div class="why-list">

                    <div class="why-item">

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>

                        <span>
                            Creative and modern album layouts
                        </span>

                    </div>


                    <div class="why-item">

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>

                        <span>
                            Attention to every small detail
                        </span>

                    </div>


                    <div class="why-item">

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>

                        <span>
                            Professional photo editing
                        </span>

                    </div>


                    <div class="why-item">

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>

                        <span>
                            Designs made around your memories
                        </span>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- WHY CARD -->
            <div class="why-card">

                <div class="why-card-icon">
                    <i class="bi bi-camera2"></i>
                </div>

                <h3>
                    Your Memories.
                    <br>
                    Our Creativity.
                </h3>

                <p>
                    Let's turn your photographs into something
                    you'll love looking at for years.
                </p>

                <a href="/somnath/contact">

                    Contact Us

                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i>

                </a>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =========================
         CTA
    ========================== -->
        <section class="about-cta">

            <div>

                <span class="section-label">
                    LET'S WORK TOGETHER
                </span>

                <h2>
                    Have Memories
                    <span>Worth Remembering?</span>
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Let us turn your photographs into a beautiful album.
                </p>

            </div>


            <a href="/somnath/contact" class="cta-button">

                Get In Touch

                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>

            </a>

        </section>

    </div>